book typescript_proto v1
description "A transfer with a parameter named __proto__: the TypeScript client takes the arguments as one object, and an object literal takes __proto__ for the object's prototype, not for a property"

unit pcs

account stock(sku: string) : pcs
  at least 0 refused as out_of_stock
account suppliers : pcs outside
account customers : pcs outside

transfer receive(__proto__: string, sku: string, qty: pcs)
  key __proto__, sku
  move qty from suppliers to stock(sku)

transfer ship(order: string, sku: string, qty: pcs)
  key order, sku
  move qty from stock(sku) to customers
